					}
				},
				{
					"id": "shop_explanation",
					"value": {
						"text": "Welcome to the Shop, where you can find new things to collect and shine among your peers!\n\n\nIn order to support the ongoing development and server maintenance of Farever, this shop will at some point feature armour skins, mounts, pets, gliders, and other cool-looking items which will be available through a separate currency available for purchase. These items will always be optional and will not have any gameplay impact or give any advantage to players who purchase them.\n\n\nThe shop is currently being worked on, but as a thank you for supporting Farever during its Early Access period, you can already find some items available to you for free!"
					}
				},
