					"value": {
						"text": ""
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "feedback_title_hint",
					"value": {
						"text": "Describe your feedback"
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "feedback_location_useful",
					"value": {
						"text": "My in-game location is relevant"
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "feedback_done",
					"value": {
						"text": "Feedback sent"
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "welcome_header",
					"value": {
						"text": "Farever"
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "welcome_desc",
					"value": {
						"text": "The team at Shiro Games has put their heart and soul into this game and we are really thankful for your early support as we begin the journey into Farever.\n\nIn this version of the game, you'll be able to explore Siagarta across <highlight>two vast regions</highlight>, with over a <highlight>hundred activities</highlight> and a <highlight>lot of builds available</highlight> by mixing our 4 Classes, 6 Jobs and 100+ weapon skills available across many unique weapons.\n\nThe game is still in Early Access version though, which means that there might be issues here and there. If you encounter any, don't hesitate to report it through our in-game tool so we can get to fixing it as soon as we can. You can use the same tool to send us feedback and suggestions. We are looking forward to hearing from you and making the game better together.\n\nAs for new content coming later this year, you will be able to rise <highlight>up to level 25</highlight> and visit new regions with more dungeons, more bosses, and <highlight>new mechanics</highlight> like World Events, Dungeons Heroic Mode, and <highlight>Social Features</highlight> like PVP, communications tools, and guilds!\n\nWe hope you'll enjoy our Early Access, if you do, be sure to <highlight>leave a review</highlight> on Steam and <highlight>stay in touch with our incoming content</highlight>!"
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "ptr_message",
					"value": {
						"group": [
							{
								"id": "Title",
								"value": {
									"text": "Farever"
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Desc",
								"value": {
									"text": "Welcome to the Nightling Invasion preview.\n\n\nThe Major Update Community Preview is a pre-release version of the game that allows us to gather early feedback for incoming features. It also allows us to improve performance and check the stability of the build before its launch.\n\n\nWe strongly recommend playing in English, as some text in your language may appear in English during this phase. This will, of course, be corrected when the update is officially released.\n\n\nTo allow you to focus on the upcoming tests and avoid having to farm, merchants are offering all the game’s weapons and armour for purchase, and we have disabled the ability to loot legendary items and other ultra-rare rewards. Your characters on this branch will also progress independently from their live-server counterparts.\n\n\nDuring this first phase, the two sub-regions of Ramburg, the Barracks dungeon and the Rifts featuring the first Rift boss are available.\n\n\nSome of the update’s content is not yet available and will be rolled out following early feedback and as the test progresses (additional dungeon, second Rift boss, currencies and rewards, new weapons, jobs recipes...)."
								}
							}
						]
					}
				},
				{
					"id": "intro",
					"value": {
						"group": [
							{
								"id": "Title",
								"value": {
									"text": "Welcome to the beta"
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Text1",
								"value": {
									"text": "For millenia, an eternal rivalry opposed Nightlings and Sunlings. But the perfect balance of this duel was broken when a Sunling monarch unleashed the radiant power of the Spark and vowed to unify the 9 worlds under his banner."
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Text2",
								"value": {
									"text": "Defeated by an unprecedented alliance of all known worlds, the Sunlings were forced into exile and sealed themselves inside the forlorn, faraway half-realm of Antelimbo. Thus began the Chrysalis Age."
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Text3",
								"value": {
									"text": "It was only after five centuries of isolation that the sealed gates of Antelimbo mysteriously reopened, ushering an age of rediscovery. The Sunlings were now free to rejoin their native world of Siagarta."
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Text4",
								"value": {
									"text": "But Siagarta had changed, and time had changed them too. And this old, forgotten world that stretched out before their eyes was about to become the theater of a new, undiscovered history."
								}
							},
							{
								"id": "Text5",
								"value": {
									"text": "As one of the new generation of Sunlings, you rise at the dawn of a new era."
								}
							}
						]
					}
				},
