					"name": "flags",
					"documentation": "IsMetaStatus: When applied by two different instigators, does not apply both separately\nHidden: Skill will not be shown in automatic UIs (passive bar for instance)\nSubSkill: Supposed to be part of another skill, cannot be cast and will be filtered out of available skills\nDontDismount: Player stay mounted if using this skill."
