					"nature": 1,
					"texts": {
						"desc": "Strikes forward, dealing ::dmg:: to an enemy and generates a ::ref_name::, stacking up to ::ref_stacks:: times.\n\nAt ::ref_stacks:: stacks, your next ::name:: releases the darts, dealing randomly ::dmg2:: or ::dmg3::.",
