					"script": "// var1: How many sprayed fondue runs in a row\n// var2: Room with inverted trains (negative value to disable)\n// var3: move speed factor when changing room or using SprayedFondue\n// salvo: cooldown between two train in seconds for each phase\n// wait1: how long before summoning dockerTrain when changing phase\n// delay: how many seconds ahead of trains to trigger avoidance (negative value means no avoidance)\n// range: Distance to avoidance point to trigger Chuck's dodge\n// summon1: DockerTrain foe group"
